# Display manager. The compositor is Huginn's own (54-huginn-compositor.list), for the desktop and for the sign-in
# screen alike: KWin and Plasma are no longer in the image (config/not-wanted.list).
sddm
xwayland
xdg-desktop-portal-kde
xdg-user-dirs
# Once brought in by Plasma's workspace, still used: KDE's look and file dialogs for Qt apps (QT_QPA_PLATFORMTHEME=kde),
# location for Weather and Maps (the Privacy settings), screen makers' names in Displays.
plasma-integration
geoclue-2.0
hwdata
# Shell services. Notifications, power, the hardware keys, Wi‑Fi passwords and Bluetooth pairing are Huginn's own
# session daemon (apps/huginn_sessiond.py); Plasma's (plasma-nm, plasma-pa, powerdevil, bluedevil) are not-wanted.
kde-cli-tools
kio-extras
libnotify-bin
wireplumber
bluez
upower
# Theming
breeze
breeze-gtk-theme
kde-config-gtk-style
qt6-style-kvantum
qt-style-kvantum-themes
# Icons: Huginn's own theme (scripts/make-icons.py, in the overlay), with Breeze's underneath for anything it doesn't draw
breeze-icon-theme
fonts-inter-variable
fonts-jetbrains-mono
fonts-noto-core
fonts-noto-color-emoji
# Native apps (deliberately few)
udisks2
ffmpeg
gvfs-backends
gvfs-fuse
avahi-utils
# App delivery (no snapd): Flatpak, driven by the Huginn App Store
flatpak
# Huginn runtime (Phase 2 replaces this with the huginn .deb)
python3
python3-pyqt6
python3-pyqt6.qtwebengine
# Installer
# Huginn's password prompt (apps/huginn_polkit.py) speaks to polkit through its own GObject bindings
gir1.2-polkit-1.0
pkexec
